<h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-on-surface leading-[1.05] tracking-tighter mb-6">Matt Geiss</h1>
<p class="text-xl text-on-surface-variant font-medium mb-6">Owner, Junk Away We Go Demolition Inc.</p>
<div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
<p>Matt founded Junk Away We Go in 2020 after more than a decade working across construction, site management, and logistics in Southern California. He started the company with one truck, a dump trailer, and a simple idea: post the prices, show up on time, and leave the job site cleaner than you found it.</p>
<p>Today Matt runs every job personally out of Poway. When you text for a quote, Matt is the one reading the photos. When the crew pulls up in the driveway, Matt is usually on the tailgate. It's the difference between a small local operation and a national franchise, and it's why he prefers to keep it that way.</p>
<p>Junk Away We Go holds CA Contractor's License #1128050 and carries full general liability and workers' compensation insurance.</p>
</div>
